<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Result of Philippine pro league.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Result of Philippine pro league.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the third game on Sunday in the finals of the Philippine Basketball Association second conference, which includes one American import for each team:</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Alaska Milk 85-77 (44-39)</p>
</text>
